<title>BAHRAIN: Saudi Real Estate's H1 97 net profit drops 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Saudi Real Estate's H1 97 net profit drops 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			    (million Saudi riyals)</p>
<p> Net profit		 23.5   vs    33.9</p>
<p> Total profit	     65.6   vs    63.4</p>
<p> Expenses		   42.1   vs    29.5</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds 1,202.9   vs 1,192.9</p>
<p> Assets		  1,336.4   vs 1,387.1</p>
<p>Full Name: The Saudi Real Estate Company.</p>
<p>Note - The Riyadh-based firm is traded on the Saudi market. -- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
